cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Oviz, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Oviz: interactive visualization of the Milky Way in 3D, on the sky, and through time"
abstract: >-
  Oviz is a Python package that turns Gaia-derived phase-space data, stationary
  layers, sky imagery, and 3D volumes into a single interactive HTML figure.
  It integrates trajectories with galpy, renders scenes in Three.js, projects
  them onto survey imagery with Aladin Lite, and saves guided sequences of
  viewer States for papers, talks, and websites.
